WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000021392 — Episode 43 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:06.110
Yeah, there's your truth.

2
00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:07.110
Look at him.

3
00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:11.510
If I really drained the astral, if I were the dragon god's chosen, would this little guy

4
00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:14.750
be drooling on my hand?

5
00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:18.590
Bottom line, I'm not going down for something I didn't do.

6
00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:23.970
It's the hole in the whole Balmarts scheme.

7
00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:24.970
Aris himself!

8
00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:25.970
He's a fool!

9
00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:28.290
He doesn't even know what he's holding.

10
00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:31.730
Caspian, you and that idiot son of yours on your knees.

11
00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:35.930
Now, beg this crowd for forgiveness and answer for every future you destroy.

12
00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:37.230
Make them pay!

13
00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:39.330
Make them pay!

14
00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:46.770
We will not confess to crimes we didn't commit, but to settle this, I will give my entire fortune

15
00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:49.170
to rebuild the Ultraman.

16
00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:52.130
An altar with no relic is just a pile of rocks, Caspian.

17
00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:56.650
Pay with something equal to the resonance astralope, or you and your boy pay in blood.

18
00:00:56.650 --> 00:00:57.650
Fine.

19
00:00:57.650 --> 00:01:03.480
I'm done arguing.

20
00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:06.120
You want a treasure that matches the astralope?

21
00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:08.080
This is everything I own.

22
00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:08.320
Take it.
